    "created_at": "2016-10-25T11:26:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-25T11:26:43Z",
    "body": "And #1567. It seems like the model is basically incorrect. Elements presumably have some kind of flag that indicates whether they're currently activatable or some such and that flag is what's checked, not whether they have activation behavior.\n",
