    "created_at": "2016-10-27T15:32:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-27T15:32:43Z",
    "body": "We have a [defaultHandled](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/events/Event.h?q=Event.h&sq=package:chromium&l=202) flag on the event.\n\nUltimately in Blink's implementation we have these steps after 13.\n\n13) Set Event target to be target\n14) Set event’s eventPhase attribute to NONE.\n15) Set event’s currentTarget attribute to null.\n16) If Event not defaultPrevented\n   For each tuple in event’s path, in order:\n    1) Invoke defaultEventHandler\n    2) If Event defaultHandled break;\n17) Unset event’s dispatch flag, stop propagation flag, and stop immediate propagation flag.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
